{'symbol': 'LMT', 'date': '2022-03-01 21:03:00', 'title': "NOAA'S GOES-T WEATHER SATELLITE, BUILT BY LOCKHEED MARTIN, SUCCESSFULLY LAUNCHES", 'text': 'CAPE CANAVERAL SPACE FORCE STATION, FLA., MARCH 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SPACE AND EARTH WEATHER FORECASTING ACROSS THE WESTERN HEMISPHERE JUST GOT A LITTLE BOOST THANKS TO THE GEOSTATIONARY OPERATIONAL ENVIRONMENTAL SATELLITE (GOES-T), AN ADVANCED WEATHER SATELLITE BUILT BY LOCKHEED MARTIN [NYSE: LMT] FOR THE NATIONAL OCEANIC AND ATMOSPHERIC ADMINISTRATION (NOAA).'}